{"kp_id": "zj-037.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-037", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "膈俞为血会（八会之一），血病可针可灸。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.bl17", "new.concept.八会穴"], "chapter_id": "zj-037.c01", "evidence_quote": "格余呢叫做穴会隔余", "seg_from": 11, "seg_to": 24, "start_s": 48.18, "end_s": 167.8, "citation": {"youtube_id": "PWyzeMCBMZE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PWyzeMCBMZE&t=48s", "series": "zj", "episode": 37, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Records\": Acupuncture, 90-Episode Series - Acupuncture 37", "start_s": 48.18, "end_s": 167.8}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "格余/隔余=膈俞；晦穴=会穴", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-037.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-037", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "肝经过前后阴；阴部、睾丸病可取肝俞（不单取井穴）。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.bl18", "meridian.lr"], "chapter_id": "zj-037.c01", "evidence_quote": "阴部有病，我们可以在肝郁上面下沉", "seg_from": 155, "seg_to": 155, "start_s": 841.72, "end_s": 859.6, "citation": {"youtube_id": "PWyzeMCBMZE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PWyzeMCBMZE&t=841s", "series": "zj", "episode": 37, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Records\": Acupuncture, 90-Episode Series - Acupuncture 37", "start_s": 841.72, "end_s": 859.6}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "肝郁=肝俞", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-037.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-037", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "结核等可用胆俞；四花灸常用膈俞、胆俞等四穴。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.bl19", "new.method.四花灸"], "chapter_id": "zj-037.c01", "evidence_quote": "所谓的四花灸", "seg_from": 197, "seg_to": 201, "start_s": 1102.58, "end_s": 1136.165, "citation": {"youtube_id": "PWyzeMCBMZE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PWyzeMCBMZE&t=1102s", "series": "zj", "episode": 37, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Records\": Acupuncture, 90-Episode Series - Acupuncture 37", "start_s": 1102.58, "end_s": 1136.16}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-037.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-037", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "胃俞配中脘为俞募；三焦俞配石门（三焦募），治水道、下利、水肿、腹胀不化等。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.bl21", "acupoint.bl22", "acupoint.cv5", "new.concept.俞募配穴"], "chapter_id": "zj-037.c02", "evidence_quote": "三焦是也是水道，那下利啊，大便都带血啊", "seg_from": 249, "seg_to": 294, "start_s": 1401.22, "end_s": 1693.78, "citation": {"youtube_id": "PWyzeMCBMZE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PWyzeMCBMZE&t=1401s", "series": "zj", "episode": 37, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Records\": Acupuncture, 90-Episode Series - Acupuncture 37", "start_s": 1401.22, "end_s": 1693.78}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "位鱼=胃俞；石穴=石门；鱼雾=俞募", "source": "llm_read"}
